"information stored on your computer. Some conditions, such as refraction of "
"light through the air, are hard to model. Resultantly, the calculated values"
" for sunrise and sunset may be off by up to 10 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Saullēkta un saulrieta laiks tiek aprēķināts lokāli pēc datorā saglabātā "
"platuma un garuma. Dažus apstākļus, piemēram, gaismas laušanu gaisā, ir "
"grūti modelēt, tāpēc aprēķinātie saullēkta un saulrieta laiki var atšķirties "
"līdz pat 10 minūtēm."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/title
#: C/index.docbook:760
msgid "Forecast"
msgstr "Prognoze"

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:761
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Forecast</guilabel> tabbed section displays a forecast for the"
" location for the immediate future, usually the next five days."
msgstr ""
"Cilnē <guilabel>Prognoze</guilabel> redzama laika prognoze šai vietai "
"tuvākajam laikam, parasti nākamajām piecām dienām."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:765
msgid ""
"Forecasts are only available for some locations in the U.S., Australia and "
"the United Kingdom."
msgstr ""
"Prognozes ir pieejamas tikai dažām vietām ASV, Austrālijā un Apvienotajā "
"Karalistē."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/title
#: C/index.docbook:772
msgid "Radar Map"
msgstr "Radara karte"

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:773
msgid ""
"By default, the <guilabel>Radar Map</guilabel> tabbed section is not "
"displayed in the <guilabel>Forecast</guilabel> dialog. <application>Weather "
"Report</application> downloads the radar maps from www.weather.com. If the "
"radar map is not available from www.weather.com, Weather Report displays a "
"question mark. To go to the www.weather.com web site, click on the "
"<guibutton>Visit Weather.com</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Pēc noklusējuma cilne <guilabel>Radara karte</guilabel> dialoglodziņā "
"<guilabel>Prognoze</guilabel> netiek rādīta. <application>Laika ziņas</"
"application> lejupielādē radara kartes no www.weather.com. Ja "
"www.weather.com radara karte nav pieejama, Laika ziņas rāda jautājuma zīmi. "
"Lai atvērtu tīmekļa vietni www.weather.com, noklikšķiniet uz pogas "
"<guibutton>Apmeklēt Weather.com</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:782
msgid ""
"Go to the <guilabel>Weather Preferences</guilabel> dialog by selecting "
"<guilabel>Preferences</guilabel> in the right-click menu."
msgstr ""
"Atveriet dialoglodziņu <guilabel>Laika ziņu iestatījumi</guilabel>, "
"konteksta izvēlnē atlasot <guilabel>Iestatījumi</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:783
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>General</guilabel> tab, select the <guilabel>Enable radar "
"map</guilabel> option."
msgstr ""
"Cilnē <guilabel>Vispārīgi</guilabel> atlasiet iespēju <guilabel>Iespējot "
"radara karti</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:784
msgid ""
"By default, <application>Weather Report</application> downloads the radar "
"maps from www.weather.com. Select the <guilabel>Use custom address for radar"
" map</guilabel> option to display radar maps from an alternative Internet "
"address. You must type the address in the <guilabel>Address</guilabel> text "
"box."
msgstr ""
"Pēc noklusējuma <application>Laika ziņas</application> lejupielādē radara "
"kartes no www.weather.com. Atlasiet iespēju <guilabel>Lietot pielāgotu "
"adresi radara kartei</guilabel>, lai rādītu radara kartes no citas interneta "
"adreses. Adrese jāievada teksta lodziņā <guilabel>Adrese</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:780
msgid ""
"To enable the radar map, perform the following steps: <_:orderedlist-1/>"
msgstr "Lai iespējotu radara karti, veiciet šīs darbības: <_:orderedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:787
msgid ""
"Most locations do not define a default radar map, especially outside of the "
"U.S. Many locations will require you to specify a custom URL, if you wish to"
" have a radar map."
msgstr ""
"Lielākajai daļai vietu, it īpaši ārpus ASV, noklusējuma radara karte nav "
"definēta. Daudzām vietām, ja vēlaties redzēt radara karti, būs jānorāda "
"pielāgots URL."

